NC Digital builds fast, modern, SEO-focused websites for small businesses across the Vale of Glamorgan — including Barry, Penarth, Cowbridge, and the surrounding area.

> "A well-built website is your digital shopfront — it should be fast, clear, and designed to convert visitors into customers."

## Why web design in the Vale of Glamorgan matters

The Vale of Glamorgan is home to a thriving local business community. Customers search online before they make contact — and if your business isn't showing up, a competitor is getting that call.

We build websites with local search built in, combining strong service pages, location signals, and technical SEO so Vale of Glamorgan businesses get found.

## What's included in our web design packages

Every Vale of Glamorgan web design project includes:

- Custom website optimised for speed, clarity, and conversions
- Mobile-first design tested across all devices
- On-page SEO targeting the Vale of Glamorgan and surrounding areas
- Secure UK-based hosting with SSL and performance optimisation
- Full content management access — no locked templates
- Google Analytics setup
- Training so you can manage your own site

